commit 91c5f0b0c6b0028f12f68d9820670d5cd4e4942a
Author: TarimoPaul <chiefmaster7066@gmail>
Date:   Mon Oct 19 15:09:12 2026 +0300

    GL Toleo 1 (2.2.71, V134): posting failures, H-1/H-2/H-5 fixes, period close
    
    - gl_posting_failure: every swallowed GL post is kept and can be retried
    - H-2: POS sale journal posted after commit, from the sale as stored
    - H-1: day-close variance sign fixed (SHORTAGE / SURPLUS capped / OVER_DEDUCTION /
      NOT_COUNTED) + one-off correction endpoint with dry run; Q9 surplus to 2900 Suspense,
      kept on daily_financial_snapshot.variance_target and carried to re-approvals
    - H-5: reopen / supersede reverse the variance journal on the original date;
      only APPROVED reconciliations are posted
    - idempotent re-posts (typed live-journal check, ALREADY_POSTED) and a per-reference
      pg_advisory_xact_lock in executePost (two simultaneous posts -> one journal)
    - GL periods: close / reopen with reason and audit, late entries booked on the first
      open day with event_date
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

